        "text": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Curated specialty bench in Ilwaco—not a warehouse dump. Natural materials give mottling and movement; synthetics add durability and consistent color. Full-price hub—timed Select-feather deals stay on the Labor Day sale collection.</p><p>Need weight? See <a href=\"/collections/fly-tying-beads#bead-sizing\">bead↔hook sizing on the beads page</a>.</p>"
